{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Classic StuffIt archive" : {
      "comment" : "The kind of file, as Finder shows it for .sit files (the Kind column and Get Info), and the app's document type name. A noun phrase written the way Finder writes file kinds in your language (compare 'ZIP archive'). 'StuffIt' is a trademark (a Mac compression program popular in the 1990s); keep it exactly as written. 'Classic' refers to the classic Mac OS era - Macintosh computers of the 1980s and 1990s - not 'classical' or 'traditional'. 'Archive' means a compressed file container (like a .zip file) - here an old StuffIt .sit file - not a records archive, an archive room, or a backup.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
